1
00:00:09,776 --> 00:00:14,432
Hi, Fu Xing. How was your school trip to the wastewater plant?

2
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:15,920
Was it boring?

3
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:18,240
No, it wasn’t at all.

4
00:00:18,736 --> 00:00:20,720
It was really interesting!

5
00:00:21,248 --> 00:00:23,648
Wow! What did you see?

6
00:00:24,432 --> 00:00:27,792
We saw the plant make dirty water clean again.

7
00:00:28,272 --> 00:00:30,432
Really? How?

8
00:00:31,088 --> 00:00:35,808
Well, first, dirty water from our homes goes into the plant.

9
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:41,472
Then, special screens remove large pieces of waste from the water.

10
00:00:42,256 --> 00:00:44,064
What happens next?

11
00:00:44,416 --> 00:00:49,264
Well, large machines remove germs and other things from the water.

12
00:00:49,616 --> 00:00:52,304
These things are usually too small to see.

13
00:00:52,750 --> 00:00:57,264
It takes a few more steps after that before the water becomes clean again.

14
00:00:57,936 --> 00:01:02,224
Wow! I used to think it was easy to get clean water.

15
00:01:02,544 --> 00:01:06,960
Me too! I didn’t realize it was so hard.

